Explanation- For the purpose of this sub-section, "dowry" shall have the same meaning as State Vs.
Jitender Gahlot incumbent upon prosecution to prove the essential ingredients3 of the said offence:
(i) the death of Ms. Neelam had been caused by any burns or bodily injury or otherwise than under normal circumstances;
(ii) such death had occurred within 7 years of her marriage;
(iii) soon before her death the deceased Ms. Neelam had been subjected to cruelty or harassment by her husband Jitender Gahlot;
(iv) such cruelty or harassment was for or in connection with demand of dowry; and (v) such cruelty or harassment was made soon before her death.
i) Re: Whether the death of Ms. Neelam had been caused by any burns or bodily injury or otherwise than under normal circumstances?
